---
const ORDER_URL = 'https://frituurhethalfhuis.pickandgo.be/';
const FB_URL = 'https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61583588097751';
const EMAIL = 'frituurhethalfhuis@gmail.com';
const CTA_IMAGE =
	'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551782450-a2132b4ba21d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=80';
---

<section class="cta" id="contact">
	<div class="cta-bg" style={`background-image:url(${CTA_IMAGE})`}></div>
	<div class="cta-overlay"></div>

	<div class="container cta-content">
		<h2>Trek er zin in? Bestel je frietjes vandaag nog.</h2>
		<p>Kies je tijdslot, bestel online en spring binnen langs de linkse deur op Borlostraat 15.</p>

		<div class="cta-actions">
			<a class="btn btn-primary" href={ORDER_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
				🛵 Bestel &amp; haal af
			</a>
			<a class="btn btn-ghost" href={FB_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
				📘 Volg ons op Facebook
			</a>
		</div>

		<div class="cta-contact">
			<a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>✉️ {EMAIL}</a>
			<span>📍 Borlostraat 15, 3891 Mielen-Boven-Aalst</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.cta {
		position: relative;
		padding: 100px 0;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.cta-bg {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		background-size: cover;
		background-position: center;
	}

	.cta-overlay {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(20, 12, 6, 0.85), rgba(20, 12, 6, 0.9));
	}

	.cta-content {
		position: relative;
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 680px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		color: #fff;
	}

	.cta-content h2 {
		color: #fff;
		font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.4vw, 2.5rem);
	}

	.cta-content p {
		margin-top: 16px;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
		font-size: 1.05rem;
	}

	.cta-actions {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 14px;
		margin-top: 32px;
	}

	.cta-contact {
		margin-top: 36px;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 24px;
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
	}

	.cta-contact a:hover {
		color: var(--color-accent);
	}
</style>
